---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Container from '../components/Container.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';

const h2 = 'text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-10';
---

<Base title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for the Pro Footballer Life app and website.">
  <PageHeader title="Terms of Use" subtitle="Last updated: 4th November 2026" />
  <div class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8">
    <Container>
      <div class="text-[#4D4D4D] space-y-6">
        <p>These terms apply to the Pro Footballer Life game on iOS and Android (the app) and to profootballerlife.com (the website). By using the app or the website, you agree to them. If you don't agree, please don't use them.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#1F1F1F] mt-6">1. Who We Are</h2>
        <p>Assemble Games is operated by Rusu Răzvan-Iulian PFA (Persoană Fizică Autorizată), Bd. Bucureștii Noi 136, ground floor, apt. 5, Sector 1, Bucharest, Romania (CUI 54567552, Trade Register no. F2026022418007).</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>2. Your Licence to Play</h2>
        <p>We give you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to download the app and play it on devices you own or control, for your own non-commercial use. The game and its content remain ours.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>3. In-App Purchases</h2>
        <p>Purchases such as the "No Cooldowns" pack give you a licence to use virtual content in the game. Virtual content has no cash value and can't be exchanged for money, transferred or sold.</p>
        <p>Payment is handled by Apple or Google. Refunds are available only through Apple or Google, under their refund policies. See our <a class="underline" href="/support">Support</a> page for links.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>4. Updates and Changes to the Game</h2>
        <p>We update the game over time. Virtual items, features and progress may change as a result. This doesn't affect your statutory rights for content you have paid for.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>5. Rewarded Ads</h2>
        <p>Rewarded ads are optional. You choose whether to watch one to skip a wait.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>6. Fair Play</h2>
        <p>You must not:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mt-2">
          <li>Cheat, or use hacks, exploits or tools that change how the game works</li>
          <li>Reverse-engineer, decompile or modify the app, except where the law allows it</li>
          <li>Copy, resell, rent or distribute the game</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class={h2}>7. Data Packs</h2>
        <p>The app lets you import data packs from your own device to change names and logos. Any data pack you import is your responsibility, including making sure you have the right to use its content. We don't host or supply data packs.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>8. The Game Is Fiction</h2>
        <p>The clubs and people in the game are fictional. Any likeness to real clubs or people is coincidental. The game is not affiliated with, endorsed by or licensed by any club, league or competition.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>9. The Website</h2>
        <p>The website links to other services, such as Discord, TikTok, YouTube, X and Trello. Their own terms apply when you use them. Our <a class="underline" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> explains how we handle information on the website and in the app.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>10. No Warranty</h2>
        <p>To the extent the law allows, the app and the website are provided "as is" and "as available". We don't promise they will always be available or free of errors. Saves are stored only on your device, so they can be lost if you uninstall the app or your device fails.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for loss of saves or progress. Our total liability to you is limited to the amount you paid for in-app purchases in the 12 months before the claim.</p>
        <p>Nothing in these terms limits liability that can't be limited by law, such as for fraud or for death or personal injury caused by negligence. If you are a consumer in the EU, nothing in these terms limits your statutory rights.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>12. Apple Users</h2>
        <p>If you downloaded the app from the App Store, Apple's <a class="underline" href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">standard licence agreement (EULA)</a> also applies where these terms are silent. These terms are between you and us, not Apple.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>13. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>Romanian law governs these terms. If you are a consumer living in another country, you also keep the protection of that country's mandatory consumer laws.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>14. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. We will post changes on this page and update the "Last updated" date. If a change is significant, we will also mention it in the app or in its update notes. If you keep using the app or the website after a change, the new terms apply.</p>

        <h2 class={h2}>15. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about these terms, please contact us at <a class="underline" href="mailto:rusuappsupport@gmail.com">rusuappsupport@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
